{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2014-meet-science2-14","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2014,"subject":"chemistry","number":14,"points":2,"unitId":"coordination","unitLabel":"배위화학","topic":"착물·결정장·팔면체","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["coordination","electro"],"stem":"다음은 코발트 착물에 대한 환원 전위(Eo), 형성 상수(K), 정팔면체장\n에서의 결정장 갈라짐(Δo)을 나타낸 것이다. \nK1과 K2는 각각\n[Co(NH3)6]3+와 [Co(NH3)6]2+착물의 형성 상수이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. [Co(H2O)6]3+가 [Co(NH3)6]3+보다 강한 산화제이다.\nㄴ. K1은 K2보다 크다. \nㄷ. [Co(H2O)6]3+가 반자성일 때 [Co(NH3)6]3+는 반자성이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t010"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]}],"answer":5,"acceptedAnswers":[5],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":26,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[188.28,7.735,10.4,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-meet-science2-14/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":112,"height":31,"region":0,"bbox":[239.88,26.935,44.8,12.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-meet-science2-14/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":364,"height":38,"region":0,"bbox":[16.28,46.935,145.6,15.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-meet-science2-14/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":629,"height":383,"region":0,"bbox":[38.68,84.535,251.6,153.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-meet-science2-14/04.webp"},{"id":"fig-05","width":776,"height":206,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,283.735,310.4,82.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["